{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
		"name": "SSO E-Commerce API (FreeRADIUS)",
		"description": "Collection สำหรับทดสอบระบบ SSO และระบบ E-Commerce เชื่อมโยงกับ FreeRADIUS รองรับการเพิ่มสินค้า เติมเครดิต ลบสินค้า และสั่งซื้อ",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "1. SSO Login - Student",
			"event": [
				{
					"listen": "test",
					"script": {
						"exec": [
							"var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
							"if (jsonData.access_token) {",
							"    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"access_token\", jsonData.access_token);",
							"    console.log(\"Saved student access_token:\", jsonData.access_token);",
							"}"
						],
						"type": "text/javascript"
					}
				}
			],
			"request": {
				"method": "POST",
				"header": [
					{
						"key": "Content-Type",
						"value": "application/json"
					}
				],
				"body": {
					"mode": "raw",
					"raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"student66000001\",\n  \"password\": \"password1234\"\n}"
				},
				"url": {
					"raw": "http://localhost/api/auth/login",
					"protocol": "http",
					"host": [
						"localhost"
					],
					"path": [
						"api",
						"auth",
						"login"
					]
				},
				"description": "ล็อกอินบัญชีนักศึกษาผ่าน Central Auth Service (ตรวจสอบผ่าน FreeRADIUS) เพื่อรับ JWT Token (role: customer)"
			},
			"response": []
		},
		{
			"name": "2. SSO Login - Admin",
			"event": [
				{
					"listen": "test",
					"script": {
						"exec": [
							"var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
							"if (jsonData.access_token) {",
							"    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"access_token\", jsonData.access_token);",
							"    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"admin_token\", jsonData.access_token);",
							"    console.log(\"Saved admin access_token:\", jsonData.access_token);",
							"}"
						],
						"type": "text/javascript"
					}
				}
			],
			"request": {
				"method": "POST",
				"header": [
					{
						"key": "Content-Type",
						"value": "application/json"
					}
				],
				"body": {
					"mode": "raw",
					"raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin66000001\",\n  \"password\": \"password1234\"\n}"
				},
				"url": {
					"raw": "http://localhost/api/auth/login",
					"protocol": "http",
					"host": [
						"localhost"
					],
					"path": [
						"api",
						"auth",
						"login"
					]
				},
				"description": "ล็อกอินบัญชีผู้ดูแลระบบผ่าน Central Auth Service (FreeRADIUS) เพื่อรับ JWT Token ที่มีสิทธิ์ Admin (role: admin)"
			},
			"response": []
		},
